<title>FRANCE: France to send Bulgaria 5,000 T wheat as food aid.</title>
<headline>France to send Bulgaria 5,000 T wheat as food aid.</headline>
<text>
<p>PARIS, April 10 (Reuter) 10 April - France has awarded a food aid shipment of 5,000 tonnes of soft wheat to Bulgaria, cereals office ONIC said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The tender price was 1,144 francs a tonne for shipment in bags from Port La Nouvelle from April 17, it said.</p>
</text>
